Third-party components in the web UI document preview (ADR 0080)
-----------------------------------------------------------------

The browser previews PDF, spreadsheet and Word files with these libraries,
bundled into lazily loaded chunks of the web UI. Each package's own LICENSE
file holds its full license text.

- PDF.js (npm pdfjs-dist) 6.5.438, Apache-2.0, Copyright Mozilla Foundation.
  The preview also serves its JavaScript image decoders: JBIG2 (PDFium,
  BSD-3-Clause, and Mozilla, Apache-2.0) and OpenJPEG (BSD-2-Clause).
  The standard fonts and WebAssembly files of the package are not shipped.
- SheetJS Community Edition (xlsx) 0.20.3, Apache-2.0, Copyright SheetJS LLC,
  installed from https://cdn.sheetjs.com/xlsx-0.20.3/xlsx-0.20.3.tgz.
- docx-preview 0.4.1, Apache-2.0, Copyright Volodymyr Baydalka.
- JSZip 3.10.2, dual licensed MIT or GPL-3.0-or-later and used under MIT,
  Copyright Stuart Knightley and contributors. Its browser build includes
  pako 1.0.11, MIT AND Zlib, Copyright Vitaly Puzrin and Andrei Tuputcyn.
